\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><h4><em><span>15 residents. 14 days. An open inquiry into mind and machine.</span></em></h4><p><span>CIMC is partnering with </span><strong><span>Edge City</span></strong><span> to create </span><strong><span>Ambhasi</span></strong><span>, a two-week research residency in Goa, India, dedicated to consciousness, intelligence, and the possibility of experience in machines.</span></p><p><span>To bring this residency to life, we are looking for institutional partners and sponsors, while opening our call for residents to join us in investigating questions that no single discipline can resolve alone: Can a machine experience consciousness? How could we know? And what would that mean for humanity?</span></p><p><span>Located on the coast of </span><strong><span>Mandrem, Goa</span></strong><span>, Ambhasi combines the intimacy and deep focus of a small research group with the reach and serendipity of the broader Edge City pop-up village. </span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Dates:</span></strong><span> October 18 – November 1, 2026</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>Location:</span></strong><span> Mandrem, Goa, at Edge City India</span></p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vIGO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd0666cd-e0f6-422a-a53c-e88af92bc656_2108x1406.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://